---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Departments
eyebrow: Departments
lede: The offices that run Osprey Point day to day, and how to reach each one.
tags: []
breadcrumbs: []
---

{% include "partials/page-header.njk" %}

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
  <ul class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    {% for dept in collections.departments %}
      <li class="flex flex-col rounded border border-navy-100 p-6">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">
          <a href="{{ dept.url }}" class="text-navy-900 no-underline hover:underline"
            >{{ dept.data.title }}</a
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-navy-700">{{ dept.data.lede }}</p>

        <dl class="mt-4 space-y-1 border-t border-navy-100 pt-4 text-sm">
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-navy-500">Contact</dt>
            <dd class="font-semibold">{{ dept.data.director }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-navy-500">Phone</dt>
            <dd>{{ dept.data.phone }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-navy-500">Email</dt>
            <dd class="break-all">
              <a href="mailto:{{ dept.data.email }}" class="text-bay-700">{{ dept.data.email }}</a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-navy-500">Office</dt>
            <dd>{{ dept.data.location }}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="mt-10 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-navy-50 p-6">
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold">Not sure which office you need?</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-navy-700">
      Call Town Hall at {{ site.phone }} during business hours and the front desk will route
      you, or search the full
      <a href="/directory/" class="text-bay-700 underline underline-offset-2">staff directory</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
